        "text": "Base rate/reference class: recent one-month moves in this level rate are small and mean-reverting around roughly 8.0. The reference class used here is the last four official month-to-month changes in the same seasonally adjusted U-6 series: +0.1, +0.2, -0.1, and -0.2 percentage point. No July 2026 outcome data were available at runAt."
